        "original_id": "6643e7e6-3a79-592a-8091-bb5244af062a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: William Friedkin, Jon Paul Puno, Chevy Chase, Gregory Hines, Sigourney Weaver\n- Roles: film director, producer, screenwriter, filmmaker\n- Films: The French Connection, The Exorcist, Valle de Lágrimas, Peace Grows, Deal of the Century\n- Awards: Academy Award for Best Director\n\nFacts:\n- William Friedkin was born on August 29, 1935, and he is an American film director, producer, and screenwriter.\n- William Friedkin directed The French Connection in 1971 and won the Academy Award for Best Director for that film.\n- William Friedkin directed The Exorcist in 1973.\n- Deal of the Century is a 1983 American comedy film directed by William Friedkin.\n- Deal of the Century stars Chevy Chase, Gregory Hines, and Sigourney Weaver.\n- Jon Paul Puno directed Peace Grows in 2004.\n- Jon Paul Puno directed Valle de Lágrimas in 2006.",
